#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:9 85b449250c624a268e470d3801f34b7d
msgid "Soaring"
msgstr "热升气流飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:14 bf93397448d3431c99ae3161cfcf09d4
msgid ""
"The autonomous soaring functionality in ArduPilot allows the plane to "
"respond to rising air current (thermals) in order to extend endurance and"
" gain altitude with minimal use of the motor (soaring). Its full "
"technical description is available in"
msgstr "ArduPilot 中的自主热升气流飞行功能允许飞机响应上升气流（热气流）以延长续航并以最少的电机使用量获得高度（热升气流飞行）。其完整技术描述见"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:18 36aa684e67484fd7b4c968659f0ea65f
msgid ""
"*S. Tabor, I. Guilliard, A. Kolobov.* `ArduSoar: an Open-Source "
"Thermalling Controller for Resource-Constrained Autopilots "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.08215/>`_. *International Conference on "
"Intelligent Robots and Systems (IROS), 2018.*"
msgstr ""
"*S. Tabor, I. Guilliard, A. Kolobov.* `ArduSoar: an Open-Source "
"Thermalling Controller for Resource-Constrained Autopilots "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.08215/>`_. *International Conference on "
"Intelligent Robots and Systems (IROS), 2018.*"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:20 7a9bbc8cb7314e7383bab5bfeec944dc
msgid ""
"Use of an airspeed sensor is strongly recommended in order to obtain "
"optimum performance. Use without a sensor could yield unsatisfactory "
"results. Consistent operation without an airspeed sensor is a pending "
"future development."
msgstr "强烈建议使用空速传感器以获得最优性能。不使用传感器可能导致不理想的结果。无空速传感器的一致运行是未来待开发的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:24 58ea25c3308a44d1a4ca6f2b30197782
msgid ""
"This picture shows the different phases of flight when using the soaring "
"functionality:"
msgstr "此图展示了使用热升气流飞行功能时的不同飞行阶段："

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:27 3f427333f5274af785e86441a057e961
msgid ""
"If modes AUTO, FBWB or CRUISE are entered, and Soaring is enabled, the "
"throttle is set to zero provided the aircraft is above "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` altitude and the aircraft then begins "
"gliding."
msgstr ""
"如果进入 Auto、FBWB 或 Cruise 模式，并且启用了翱翔功能，则只要飞行器高于 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` 高度，油门将被设置为零，飞行器开始滑翔。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:28 a813d33c7e984972a69aa3638724d152
msgid ""
"If the aircraft descends to :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` altitude, "
"throttle is re-enabled and the aircraft will begin to climb to the "
"altitude of the next waypoint, in AUTO, or to "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` altitude in CRUISE or FBWB. In "
"AUTO, if the waypoint altitude is less than "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` altitude, then Soaring can not "
"begin before reaching the waypoint. If it is above "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` altitude, then Soaring can occur "
"once that altitude has been reached."
msgstr ""
"若飞机下降至 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` 高度，则重新启用油门，飞机将开始爬升至 AUTO "
"模式下一个航点的高度，或在 CRUISE 或 FBWB 模式下爬升至 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 高度。在 AUTO 模式下，若航点高度低于 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 高度，则在到达航点前无法开始热升气流飞行。若高于 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 高度，则一旦达到该高度即可开始热升气流飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:29 4ed761cdf9774428904660628fd73f0e
msgid ""
"When the aircraft reaches :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` "
"altitude, throttle is set to zero again."
msgstr "当飞行器达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 高度时，油门再次被设置为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:30 16e790ff6a5b4dd0ad58ca343cf3395e
msgid ""
"If, during gliding flight, the air is estimated to be rising at more than"
" :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` and the :ref:`RC switch position"
"<soaring_rc-switch>` allows it, the aircraft will automatically enter "
"THERMAL mode. While in THERMAL mode the aircraft will adjust the circling"
" position to better centre the thermal."
msgstr ""
"若在滑翔飞行期间，空气估计上升速率超过 :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` 且 :ref:`RC 开关位置"
"<soaring_rc-switch>` 允许，飞机将自动进入 THERMAL 模式。在 THERMAL "
"模式下，飞机将调整盘旋位置以更好地居中热气流。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:32 3511a7ed2a8a4057a186b9d796af5bb6
msgid "THERMAL mode is exited under the following conditions:"
msgstr "THERMAL 模式在以下条件下退出："

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:34 217425c0e532470cb647df58331e9ee0
msgid ":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` is reached."
msgstr "达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:35 5a1c599d237746c7bbb534149baf3f67
msgid ":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` is reached."
msgstr "达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:36 d2d66844d2254ba8a7c8e54197300cb6
msgid "Flight mode is changed by the pilot."
msgstr "飞手更改飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:37 7160263d494c41c281442b68ffb7f1af
msgid ""
"The estimate of achievable climb rate falls below "
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`, and thermalling has lasted at least "
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>` seconds."
msgstr ""
"可实现爬升速率的估计低于 :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`，且热升气流飞行已持续至少 "
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>` 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:39 dc951fa5acf1455db736f7d6f7a5bd18
msgid ""
"The aircraft drifts more than :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` - see"
" :ref:`Limit maximum distance from home<soaring_maximum-distance-from-"
"home>`"
msgstr ""
"飞机偏移超过 :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` —— 参见 :ref:`限制距 Home 的最大距离"
"<soaring_maximum-distance-from-home>`"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:41 4116172fb1364cfcbcbca472c87b91c6
msgid ""
"The flight mode will be returned to whatever it was before THERMAL was "
"triggered."
msgstr "飞行模式将恢复为触发 THERMAL 之前的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:44 ffe7a3122223429093376ed1f3fbd5a5
msgid "Airspeed Control"
msgstr "空速控制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:46 db06cdc2ff0947219f337869b4c56e0e
msgid ""
"When in SOARING, the target airspeed while cruising is set via throttle "
"stick position for FBWB and CRUISE modes, even while gliding. For AUTO "
"mode, it is set at  :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`, unless the "
":ref:`SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD<SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD>` parameter is set to a non-zero "
"value (\"0\" is default). If it is set to \"-1\", then the :ref:`soaring-"
"speed-to-fly` computed value will be used. If greater than zero, then "
"that value in meters/sec will be used for target airspeed."
msgstr ""
"在热升气流飞行模式下，FBWB 和 CRUISE 模式的巡航目标空速通过油门杆位置设定，即使在滑翔时也如此。对于 AUTO 模式，目标空速由 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` 设定，除非 "
":ref:`SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD<SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD>` 参数设为非零值（默认为 「0」）。若设为 「-1」，则使用 "
":ref:`soaring-speed-to-fly` 计算值。若大于零，则使用该值（单位：米/秒）作为目标空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:48 051ddd8754d84f3fb64ef657254e8fd4
msgid ""
"While in THERMAL mode, the target airspeed will be "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`, unless the "
":ref:`SOAR_THML_ARSPD<SOAR_THML_ARSPD>` parameter is set to a non-zero "
"value (\"0\" is default). Then that value in meters/sec will be used for "
"target airspeed instead."
msgstr ""
"在 THERMAL 模式下，目标空速为 :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`，除非 "
":ref:`SOAR_THML_ARSPD<SOAR_THML_ARSPD>` 参数设为非零值（默认为 "
"「0」），则使用该值（单位：米/秒）作为目标空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:52 f075d0a002bc469c8a6c7cf51eed1a47
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:54 1a7148793c9c47289d36111809520435
msgid ""
"To use your plane for soaring, it should ideally be a glider type "
"aircraft with a good lift to drag ratio and be equipped with an airspeed "
"sensor."
msgstr "要将您的飞机用于热升气流飞行，理想情况下应是升阻比良好的滑翔机类型飞机，并配备空速传感器。"

