#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:69 702c171d1a7046d2880f7b90b2932eee
msgid "Mission"
msgstr "任务"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:71 12a5c56c27684c089de56d2f22365e7d
msgid ""
"The main requirement for a mission is that it take the aircraft above "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` so that gliding flight is "
"initiated. To achieve this, set the waypoints' altitude(s) above "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>`."
msgstr ""
"任务的主要要求是将飞机带到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` "
"以上以启动滑翔飞行。为此，将航点高度设置在 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 以上。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:76 668431df86e44b2b82459505d78c2c06
msgid "Soaring Parameters"
msgstr "热升气流飞行参数"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:79 e059a213fb914229a437a9c2e5fc9663
