msgstr "启用"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:81 5c716c2f1bff407288369586b82a0755
msgid ""
"Set the parameter :ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` to 1 and refresh the "
"parameters. This will allow the other SOAR parameters to appear in the "
"GCS."
msgstr "将参数 :ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` 设置为 1 并刷新参数。这将允许其他 SOAR 参数在 GCS 中显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:85 ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:186
#: 509da83803794e72ad1ee4ceff1db8d5 f5f649df0bb04a4bbcd676094c7b9dba
msgid "Drag Polar"
msgstr "阻力极线"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:87 357aab66d8bc4b8aba1bda6c00dbd8e9
msgid ""
"To work out how fast the air is rising or sinking the autopilot needs to "
"know the aircraft's sink rate for a given airspeed in still air. This is "
"related to the drag polar of the plane and is specified using the "
"SOAR_POLAR parameters. :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` is the most "
"important one to set initially and is calculated using the following "
"formula:"
msgstr ""
"为计算空气上升或下沉的速度，飞控需要了解飞机在静止空气中特定空速下的下沉速率。这与飞机的阻力极线相关，使用 SOAR_POLAR "
"参数指定。:ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` 是最重要的初始设置参数，使用以下公式计算："

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:93 d9e09335b7a94cb69f8dd6ded638f7f7
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 16*Weight/Area (weight in kg, area in"
" metres squared)."
msgstr ":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 16 × 重量/翼面积（重量单位为千克，面积单位为平方米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:96 c5d343153bb34389ac8af15b58a3d9e6
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 703*Weight/Area (weight in oz, area "
"in inches squared)."
msgstr ":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 703 × 重量/翼面积（重量单位为盎司，面积单位为平方英寸）。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:99 cfd7b89a470d40f5ab231ddb9dd77316
msgid "Calculating the other parameters is explained under tuning."
msgstr "其他参数的计算方法在调参部分说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:104 c7be03545aa84e1b98051ac9b4af8d68
msgid "RC switch (Optional)"
msgstr "RC 开关（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:106 8b6c2b6e8b4f4c4a85fd192222dbf145
msgid ""
"You can use a 3-position RC switch to control when the autopilot can use "
"soaring. Set the parameter RCX_OPTION parameter for the desired channel "
"to SOAR (index 88) - see :ref:`Auxiliary Functions <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>`. The 3 positions have the following effect."
msgstr ""
"可使用三档 RC 开关控制飞控何时可以使用热升气流飞行。将所需通道的 RCX_OPTION 参数设为 SOAR（索引 88）—— 参见 "
":ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>`。三个位置的效果如下。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:108 bd6c8a053da646879b4936be74b26e6b
msgid ""
"Low. Soaring is disabled (equivalent to setting SOAR_ENABLE = 0). "
"Throttle will be used as normal. Switching to this from either of the "
"positions below, will disable Soaring and maintain the current flight "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"低位。禁用热升气流飞行（等效于设置 SOAR_ENABLE = "
"0）。油门将正常使用。从以下任一位置切换至此位置将禁用热升气流飞行并保持当前飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:110 cb262c8dc88b4ca9b064edb318c114c2
msgid ""
"Mid. Soaring will have control over throttle. The mode will not "
"automatically change to THERMAL based on detected rising air. However, "
"when manually set to THERMAL mode using RC controller or GCS, the "
"autopilot will try to follow rising air currents. It will still restore "
"the previous mode if the aircraft is not climbing, or if it drifts too "
"far (see below)."
msgstr ""
"中位。热升气流飞行将控制油门。模式不会根据探测到的上升气流自动切换到 THERMAL。但是，当使用 RC 控制器或地面站手动设置为 THERMAL"
" 模式时，飞控将尝试跟随上升气流。若飞机未爬升或偏移太远（见下文），仍会恢复到之前的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:112 7c5f3e1de06f482e9d680dc660695f00
msgid ""
"High. Fully automatic mode changes to THERMAL from AUTO, FBWB or CRUISE "
"modes in response to detected rising air, and following of rising air "
"currents."
msgstr "高位。在 AUTO、FBWB 或 CRUISE 模式下，响应探测到的上升气流，自动切换至 THERMAL 并跟随上升气流。"

