msgid ""
"When in THERMAL mode, changing the switch position between Mid and High "
"positions commands exiting thermalling and restoring the previous mode."
msgstr "在 THERMAL 模式下，在中位和高位之间切换开关位置，将命令退出热升气流飞行并恢复到之前的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:127 de35df623a9149a698110d0d8a8cdc1b
msgid ""
"When climbing back to altitude under throttle, changing the switch "
"position to Low and back aborts the climb and starts gliding."
msgstr "在使用油门爬升回高度时，将开关切换到低位再切回将中止爬升并开始滑翔。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:131 017cefea0b70421eabd5d1dd713be631
msgid "Set limits"
msgstr "设置限制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:133 ba39f66232694466bff45ddf215878b2
msgid ""
"Because the soaring feature can follow rising air as required to gain "
"altitude, it is important to set limits to avoid it leaving the original "
"flight area completely. This is especially important in windy conditions "
"as the autopilot will try to follow thermals downwind. There are three "
"ways to set limits."
msgstr "由于热升气流飞行功能可以根据需要跟随上升气流以获得高度，因此设置限制以避免飞机完全离开原始飞行区域非常重要。在有风的情况下尤其重要，因为飞控会尝试跟随热气流顺风飞行。有三种设置限制的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:136 d08001ac218b4cbf84fba05999dd259b
msgid "Altitude limits"
msgstr "高度限制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:138 fdd655c1420e440da65517c1d199eeb6
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` sets the altitude you want the "
"autopilot to stop thermalling. :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` sets the"
" minimum altitude you want the autopilot to descend to while gliding."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` "
"设置您希望飞控停止盘旋热气流的高度。:ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` 设置您希望飞控在滑翔时下降到的最低高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:143 bad84766feec479d9306a19b93055ef8
msgid "Spatial limits"
msgstr "空间限制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:145 27a00f13d4414f08bb625222e86665b3
msgid ""
"The parameter :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` can be used to limit "
"how far (in metres) the aircraft can drift while in THERMAL mode. If the "
"aircraft reaches this limit in THERMAL mode, it will revert to the "
"original flight mode."
msgstr ""
"参数 :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` 可用于限制飞机在 THERMAL "
"模式下可偏移的距离（单位：米）。若飞机在 THERMAL 模式下达到此限制，将恢复到原始飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:147 8f46e19e5eba4cd6865f459f325bcfd9
msgid ""
"If the original flight mode was FBWB or CRUISE mode, the drift distance "
"is measured from the location THERMAL was entered."
msgstr "若原始飞行模式为 FBWB 或 CRUISE 模式，偏移距离从进入 THERMAL 的位置开始测量。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:149 9e89b8d681ff4bf78504b7be817297cd
msgid ""
"If the original flight mode was AUTO mode, the drift distance is measured"
" from the closest point on the mission segment to where THERMAL was "
"entered. Drift sideways or backwards, but not along the original mission "
"track, is counted. This allows thermalling to continue if the wind is "
"moving the aircraft in the direction of the next waypoint."
msgstr ""
"若原始飞行模式为 AUTO 模式，偏移距离从进入 THERMAL "
"处最近任务段上的点开始测量，计算侧向或向后的偏移，但不计算沿原始任务航迹方向的偏移。若风将飞机向下一个航点方向吹，则热升气流飞行可继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:153 ec17460064a74f3fbf076834f9d6a038
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The image below shows a scenario where the mission track is north to "
"south and the wind is causing thermals to drift east to west. The "
"aircraft will follow them but will respect "
":ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>`. Note that sometimes it will go a "
"little beyond  :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` as it lines up its "
"heading to the next waypoint before reverting to AUTO mode."
msgstr ""
"下图展示了任务航迹为南北方向而风使热气流向东西方向漂移的场景。飞机将跟随热气流但会遵守 "
":ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>`。注意有时会稍微超过 "
":ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>`，因为在恢复至 AUTO 模式前需要将航向对准下一个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:158 3a96c724cede44358c4d6c6bc9e1f216
msgid ""
"If using FBWB or CRUISE mode, the parameter "
":ref:`SOAR_MAX_RADIUS<SOAR_MAX_RADIUS>` can be used to trigger RTL if the"
" aircraft is more than this distance from home when in THERMAL mode. Note"
" that this parameter won't stop the aircraft from exceeding this distance"
" before it enters THERMAL mode."
msgstr ""
"若使用 FBWB 或 CRUISE 模式，参数 :ref:`SOAR_MAX_RADIUS<SOAR_MAX_RADIUS>` 可用于在 "
"THERMAL 模式下飞机距 Home 超过此距离时触发 RTL。注意此参数不会阻止飞机在进入 THERMAL 模式前超过此距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:160 56c3baa09c824924a8d979a67a36eae3
msgid ""
":ref:`Geofence <geofencing>` can be used as a last line of defence. Set "
"it up in the usual way."
msgstr ":ref:`地理围栏 <geofencing>` 可作为最后一道防线。按常规方式设置即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:165 4bd1977751cf4855b7378aecb6d01e90
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:168 458e4a4c014b489a9d5c040b29b29c9e
msgid "Triggering lift"
msgstr "触发上升气流"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:170 369879cc7af64ad8b7e2d5ffc2a67312
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` controls when the mode will be changed to"
" THERMAL. The default of 0.7m/s may be too low if you fly in strong "
"conditions. Increasing this value makes the aircraft more \"picky\" about"
" the lift it will try to circle in."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` 控制何时将模式切换至 THERMAL。默认值 0.7 m/s "
"在强风条件下可能太低。增大此值使飞机对盘旋的上升气流更「挑剔」。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:175 9ffa38cb73a24c8680c1bfbc089807b9
msgid "Thermalling bank angle"
msgstr "热升气流坡度角"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:177 417f4f3b68b346d4a21313e0066e0c00
msgid ""
"The parameter :ref:`SOAR_THML_BANK<SOAR_THML_BANK>` sets the bank angle "
"when thermalling. 30 - 45 degrees works well depending on the size of the"
" thermals in your area."
msgstr ""
"参数 :ref:`SOAR_THML_BANK<SOAR_THML_BANK>` 设置热升气流飞行时的坡度角。根据您所在地区热气流的大小，30 至"
" 45 度效果良好。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:179 69d163a6e5c74a0da29fead1ee65e335
msgid ""
"If the aircraft is not achieving this average bank angle when "
"thermalling, you should check -"
msgstr "若飞机在热升气流飞行时未能达到此平均坡度角，应检查——"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:181 71d6ddc935a24fdd954f4963c4d642d9
msgid ""
"that the limiting bank angle :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` is set"
" a bit larger than SOAR_THML_BANK (note the units are different) to give "
"some room for manoeuvring;"
msgstr ""
"限制坡度角 :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` 的设置应比 SOAR_THML_BANK "
"稍大（注意单位不同），以留出机动空间；"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:183 382b10057fc24bd98bcc0886d9b7c5b9
msgid ""
"that the navigation parameter NAVL1_PERIOD is no larger than the time "
"needed for a complete turn at the specified bank angle."
msgstr "导航参数 NAVL1_PERIOD 不应大于在指定坡度角完成一圈转弯所需的时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:188 3b574f80a5134e2aad5fad6265df8809
msgid ""
"While the default settings for :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_B<SOAR_POLAR_B>` and "
":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_CD0<SOAR_POLAR_CD0>` should be OK for most foamie-style "
"glider aircraft, improving the accuracy of these parameters will improve "
"how your aircraft detects and centres lift. You can use `this spreadsheet"
" <https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d"
"/1WA9CXRSPBc6mFydhQ3O_2SeDrQoFH1UrdiXd0PJ-zE4/edit?usp=sharing>`__ to "
"calculate better values from glide tests."
msgstr ""
"虽然 :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_B<SOAR_POLAR_B>` 和 "
":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_CD0<SOAR_POLAR_CD0>` "
"的默认设置对大多数泡沫滑翔机风格的飞行器应该没问题，但提高这些参数的准确性将改善飞行器检测和居中升力的能力。您可以使用 `此电子表格 "
"<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d"
"/1WA9CXRSPBc6mFydhQ3O_2SeDrQoFH1UrdiXd0PJ-zE4/edit?usp=sharing>`__ "
"从滑翔测试中计算更好的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:193 434864c1db1b4f60abfeb4854e684d29
msgid "Time hysteresis"
msgstr "时间滞后"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:195 fd80e3f2312244c39ec257330387c45b
msgid "Adding hysteresis can reduce the frequency of mode changes."
msgstr "添加滞后可以减少模式切换的频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:197 06456b85cbc946c69c4e3136f7456ac6
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>`: Minimum time to remain in "
"THERMAL once entered for a thermal before exiting due to low lift or "
"altitude limits."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>`：进入 THERMAL 后，在因低上升气流或高度限制退出前，保持在 "
"THERMAL 的最短时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:199 39a8fc58ec0f44c4ba34a6f155e8f576
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S<SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S>`: Minimum time to remain in glide "
"after exiting THERMAL due to low lift or altitude limits before entering "
"mode again, or when entering Soaring initially."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S<SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S>`：因低上升气流或高度限制退出 THERMAL 后，在再次进入 "
"THERMAL 模式或初次进入热升气流飞行前，保持滑翔的最短时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:202 3b8a1e102e284bbdb269866419c37c07
msgid "TECS Tuning"
msgstr "TECS 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:206 395bf2cf25c64487bb66d59d67c12181
msgid ""
"In firmware revisions before 4.1, it was necessary to set "
":ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` to 2.0 when using soaring. This is "
"now handled automatically."
msgstr ""
"在 4.1 之前的固件版本中，使用热升气流飞行时需要将 :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` 设为 "
"2.0。现在已自动处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:209 52531993ee7a467786ad1e5fd843c8e3
msgid ""
"For best results the TECS needs to be set up to fly the aircraft at a "
"consistent airspeed when gliding."
msgstr "为获得最佳结果，TECS 需要设置为在滑翔时以一致的空速飞行飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:212 fb989459d2dc45a996f37e9ea7bc63d3
msgid ""
"If your aircraft has trouble maintaining airspeed accurately you can tune"
" it by confirming that :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` is set to "
"2.0, :ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` to 1 and set "
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` to a large number, say 50.0, or use the "
":ref:`RC switch<soaring_rc-switch-upcoming>` to inhibit mode changes. "
"This means that the aircraft will glide but will never begin thermalling."
" Set :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` to an altitude high enough "
"to allow a good length of time to be spent gliding."
msgstr ""
"若飞机难以精确保持空速，可以通过确认 :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` 设为 "
"2.0、:ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` 设为 1，并将 "
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` 设为较大数值（如 50.0），或使用 :ref:`RC 开关"
"<soaring_rc-switch-upcoming>` 抑制模式切换来调参。这意味着飞机将滑翔但不会进入热升气流飞行。将 "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 设置为足够高的高度以允许足够长的滑翔时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:219 0286ea194039410f8c6be171a7247af3
msgid ""
"Launch the aircraft and put it in AUTO mode. It should climb to "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` and then begin a gliding descent."
" Watch the telemetry graphs or look at the Dataflash logs after the "
"flight. Is the aircraft maintaining the demanded airspeed? The actual and"
" demanded airspeed can be seen in the onboard log as ``TECS.sp`` and "
"``TECS.spdem``, and via telemetry you can use "
"``NAV_CONTROLLER_OUTPUT.aspd_error``. Problems can usually be fixed by "
"increasing ``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` and :ref:`TECS_INTEG_GAIN<TECS_INTEG_GAIN>` "
"to achieve good airspeed tracking in gliding flight."
msgstr ""
"发射飞行器并将其置于 Auto 模式。它应该爬升至 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` "
"然后开始滑翔下降。观察数传图表或在飞行后查看数据闪存日志。飞行器是否保持了要求的空速？实际和要求的空速可以在机载日志中以 ``TECS.sp`` "
"和 ``TECS.spdem`` 查看，通过数传可以使用 "
"``NAV_CONTROLLER_OUTPUT.aspd_error``。通常可以通过增加 ``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` 和 "
":ref:`TECS_INTEG_GAIN<TECS_INTEG_GAIN>` 来解决问题，以实现滑翔飞行中良好的空速追踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:226 541c9fce4e3b4ddda6c91e79422b0b43
msgid "Speed to Fly Feature"
msgstr "飞行速度功能"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:234 d68cdaf2028c498195b2b10ae84166fb
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:237 3a8fa775f0a24d4a81111c80a768eabc
msgid "MAVLINK Telemetry"
msgstr "MAVLink 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:239 3ecd81bef927447397ec4c9b8e055d2a
msgid ""
"Currently, the only effect on telemetry is that when soaring is active "
"the climb rate item (VFR_HUD.climb) is altered. Rather that the estimated"
" vertical speed of the aircraft, the estimated vertical speed of the air "
"mass is sent. This field is used by Mission Planner and OpenTX radios to "
"produce vario audio output."
msgstr ""
"目前，热升气流飞行对数传的唯一影响是在热升气流飞行激活时，爬升速率项（VFR_HUD.climb）会发生变化。发送的不是飞机的估计垂直速度，而是空气团的估计垂直速度。此字段被"
" Mission Planner 和 OpenTX 遥控器用于产生航空仪音频输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:242 c70475e2429c47c19dfbe05f48089b60
msgid "Use of TECS synthetic airspeed"
msgstr "使用 TECS 合成空速"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:244 0f0036f5788f4782b1d9b5b32080dbde
msgid ""
"If your plane can't accommodate an airspeed sensor, it is possible to use"
" the TECS synthetic airspeed estimate "
":ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>`. Make sure you read the warning"
" regarding this feature before deciding to use it. To use this feature, "
"set the parameter :ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` to 1."
msgstr ""
"如果您的飞机无法安装空速传感器，可以使用 TECS 合成空速估算 "
":ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>`。在决定使用之前，请务必阅读有关此功能的警告。要使用此功能，请将参数"
" :ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` 设置为 1。"

